"`Connect to database\".\n\nThe \"Query\" textinput should then be enabled"
"(or you see an error below in \"Preview data\") and you can enter a"
"`SELECT` sql statement, or something else that returns"
"data.\n\n\"Execute\" the runs the query and if everything went alright"
